  "c06-examples",
  "c06-tip",
  "summary",
  "outro-yourturn"
 ],
 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "hero-01",
   "scene": "hero",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Separate pronouns. Twelve words you will see every day.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "title"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "hero-02",
   "scene": "hero",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Stage three is about fixed words.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "sub"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "hero-03",
   "scene": "hero",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "We start with the pronouns. I, he, she, we, and their friends.",
   "pause": 0.8,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-title-01",
   "scene": "c01-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Chapter one. Why we learn fixed words now.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "title"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-why-01",
   "scene": "c01-why",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Fixed words are in almost every sentence.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "p:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-why-02",
   "scene": "c01-why",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Pronouns are fixed words. So are pointing words, like the word for this.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-why-03",
   "scene": "c01-why",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هَذَا",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "hl:هَذَا"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-why-04",
   "scene": "c01-why",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "And so are question words. They come again and again.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-why-05",
   "scene": "c01-why",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Their ending never changes.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "p:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-why-06",
   "scene": "c01-why",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "So you learn each one once, as a word in a table. Then you know it for good.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-why-07",
   "scene": "c01-why",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "When you know them, every later example is easier.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "p:3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-why-08",
   "scene": "c01-why",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "You see the fixed words at once. Then you look only at the flexible ones.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-why-09",
   "scene": "c01-why",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Here are four pronouns.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-why-10",
   "scene": "c01-why",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "I.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "word:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-why-11",
   "scene": "c01-why",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَنَا",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-why-12",
   "scene": "c01-why",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "He, or it.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "word:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-why-13",
   "scene": "c01-why",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هُوَ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-why-14",
   "scene": "c01-why",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "She, or it.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "word:3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-why-15",
   "scene": "c01-why",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هِيَ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-why-16",
   "scene": "c01-why",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "We.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "word:4"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-why-17",
   "scene": "c01-why",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "نَحْنُ",
   "pause": 0.8,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-title-01",
   "scene": "c02-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Chapter two. Fixed and flexible. A quick recap.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "title"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-cols-01",
   "scene": "c02-cols",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Every word is either fixed or flexible.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-cols-02",
   "scene": "c02-cols",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "First, a fixed word.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "col:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-cols-03",
   "scene": "c02-cols",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "مَبْنِيٌّ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "hl:مَبْنِيٌّ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-cols-04",
   "scene": "c02-cols",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Its ending never changes.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-cols-05",
   "scene": "c02-cols",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The word for he never changes. It is the same in every sentence.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-cols-06",
   "scene": "c02-cols",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هُوَ",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "hl:هُوَ",
    "hl:هُوَ@2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-cols-07",
   "scene": "c02-cols",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Then, a flexible word.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "col:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-cols-08",
   "scene": "c02-cols",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "مُعْرَبٌ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "hl:مُعْرَبٌ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-cols-09",
   "scene": "c02-cols",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Its ending changes with the job.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-cols-10",
   "scene": "c02-cols",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The house, with damma.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-cols-11",
   "scene": "c02-cols",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "البَيْتُ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "hl:البَيْتُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-cols-12",
   "scene": "c02-cols",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "And after a preposition, with kasra.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-cols-13",
   "scene": "c02-cols",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "البَيْتِ",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "hl:البَيْتِ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-cols-14",
   "scene": "c02-cols",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Pronouns are fixed. Their ending stays the same, whatever the job.",
   "pause": 0.8,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-title-01",
   "scene": "c03-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Chapter three. The twelve separate pronouns.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "title"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-01",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Learn this table by heart.",
   "pause": 0.25,
   "cues": [
    "p:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-02",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Read it aloud, top to bottom, every day this week.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "head"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-03",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Each row gives the person, the number and the gender. Then the Arabic, and its meaning.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-04",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "First person, the speaker alone. A man or a woman. I.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "row:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-05",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَنَا",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-06",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The speaker with others. Two or more, men or women. We.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "row:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-07",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "نَحْنُ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-08",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Second person, the listener. One man. You.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "row:3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-09",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَنْتَ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-10",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Second person, one woman. You.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "row:4"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-11",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَنْتِ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-12",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Second person, two people, men or women. You two.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "row:5"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-13",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَنْتُمَا",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-14",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Second person, three or more. Men, or men and women. You.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "row:6"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-15",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَنْتُمْ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-16",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Second person, three or more women. You.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "row:7"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-17",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَنْتُنَّ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-18",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Third person, the absent one. One, masculine. He, or it.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "row:8"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-19",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هُوَ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-20",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Third person, one, feminine. She, or it.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "row:9"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-21",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هِيَ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-22",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Third person, two people, men or women. They, the two of them.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "row:10"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-23",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هُمَا",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-24",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Third person, three or more. Men, or men and women. They.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "row:11"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-25",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هُمْ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-26",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Third person, three or more women. They.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "row:12"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-27",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هُنَّ",
   "pause": 0.8,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-28",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "That is the whole table. Twelve words.",
   "pause": 0.8,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-tip1-01",
   "scene": "c03-tip1",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "A tip. Watch the small vowels.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "show"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-tip1-02",
   "scene": "c03-tip1",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "For one man, fatha on the last letter.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-tip1-03",
   "scene": "c03-tip1",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَنْتَ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "hl:أَنْتَ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-tip1-04",
   "scene": "c03-tip1",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "For one woman, kasra on the last letter.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-tip1-05",
   "scene": "c03-tip1",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَنْتِ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "hl:أَنْتِ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-tip1-06",
   "scene": "c03-tip1",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "For a group of men, the last letter is an m, with sukūn.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-tip1-07",
   "scene": "c03-tip1",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هُمْ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "hl:هُمْ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-tip1-08",
   "scene": "c03-tip1",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "For a group of women, the last letter is an n, with a shadda.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-tip1-09",
   "scene": "c03-tip1",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هُنَّ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "hl:هُنَّ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-tip1-10",
   "scene": "c03-tip1",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "A small mark, or one letter, changes the meaning. So read every letter and every vowel.",
   "pause": 0.8,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-tip2-01",
   "scene": "c03-tip2",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "A side note. Each pronoun is built on one fixed mark.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "show"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-tip2-02",
   "scene": "c03-tip2",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هُوَ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "hl:هُوَ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-tip2-03",
   "scene": "c03-tip2",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Built on fatha.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-tip2-04",
   "scene": "c03-tip2",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "نَحْنُ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "hl:نَحْنُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-tip2-05",
   "scene": "c03-tip2",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "On damma.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-tip2-06",
   "scene": "c03-tip2",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هُمْ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "hl:هُمْ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-tip2-07",
   "scene": "c03-tip2",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "On sukūn.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-tip2-08",
   "scene": "c03-tip2",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "You do not need to learn these.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "hl:You do not need to learn these."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-tip2-09",
   "scene": "c03-tip2",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Just remember the word never changes.",
   "pause": 0.8,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-title-01",
   "scene": "c04-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Chapter four. Three groups.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "title"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-01",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The twelve pronouns fall into three groups. Each group is one person: first, second or third.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-02",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "First person is the speaker.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "col:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-03",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "المُتَكَلِّمُ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "hl:المُتَكَلِّمُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-04",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Two words. I, and we.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-05",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَنَا",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-06",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "نَحْنُ",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-07",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Second person is the listener. The one you talk to.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "col:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-08",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "المُخَاطَبُ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "hl:المُخَاطَبُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-09",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Five words. They all begin the same way.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-10",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَنْتَ",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-11",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَنْتِ",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-12",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَنْتُمَا",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-13",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَنْتُمْ",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-14",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَنْتُنَّ",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-15",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Third person is the absent one. The one you talk about.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "col:3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-16",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "الغَائِبُ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "hl:الغَائِبُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-17",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Five words again.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-18",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هُوَ",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-19",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هِيَ",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-20",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هُمَا",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-21",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هُمْ",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-22",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هُنَّ",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-groups-23",
   "scene": "c04-groups",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Two, five and five. Twelve in all.",
   "pause": 0.8,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-tip1-01",
   "scene": "c04-tip1",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "A tip about the words for he and she.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "show"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-tip1-02",
   "scene": "c04-tip1",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هُوَ",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "hl:هُوَ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-tip1-03",
   "scene": "c04-tip1",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هِيَ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "hl:هِيَ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-tip1-04",
   "scene": "c04-tip1",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "They are also used for things.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "hl:also used for things"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-tip1-05",
   "scene": "c04-tip1",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "For a masculine noun, use",
   "pause": 0.2,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-tip1-06",
   "scene": "c04-tip1",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هُوَ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "hl:هُوَ@2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-tip1-07",
   "scene": "c04-tip1",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "For a feminine noun, use",
   "pause": 0.2,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-tip1-08",
   "scene": "c04-tip1",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هِيَ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "hl:هِيَ@2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-tip1-09",
   "scene": "c04-tip1",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "For example. Where is the watch? It is on the bed.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-tip1-10",
   "scene": "c04-tip1",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَيْنَ السَّاعَةُ؟ هِيَ عَلَى السَّرِيرِ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "hl:أَيْنَ السَّاعَةُ؟ هِيَ عَلَى السَّرِيرِ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-tip1-11",
   "scene": "c04-tip1",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The watch is a feminine noun. So we use the word for she.",
   "pause": 0.8,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-tip2-01",
   "scene": "c04-tip2",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Another tip. For two people, there is one word. Men or women, it is the same.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "show"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-tip2-02",
   "scene": "c04-tip2",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Talking to two people.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-tip2-03",
   "scene": "c04-tip2",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَنْتُمَا",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "hl:أَنْتُمَا"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-tip2-04",
   "scene": "c04-tip2",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Talking about two people.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-tip2-05",
   "scene": "c04-tip2",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هُمَا",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "hl:هُمَا"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-tip2-06",
   "scene": "c04-tip2",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "For a group of men and women together, talking to them.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "hl:a group of men and women together"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-tip2-07",
   "scene": "c04-tip2",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَنْتُمْ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "hl:أَنْتُمْ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-tip2-08",
   "scene": "c04-tip2",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Talking about them.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c04-tip2-09",
   "scene": "c04-tip2",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هُمْ",
   "pause": 0.8,
   "cues": [
    "hl:هُمْ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-title-01",
   "scene": "c05-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Chapter five. A fixed word still has a job.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "title"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-rule-01",
   "scene": "c05-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "A pronoun never changes its last vowel.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "p:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-rule-02",
   "scene": "c05-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Its ending cannot show rafʿ, naṣb or jarr.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-rule-03",
   "scene": "c05-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "But it still does a job in the sentence, like any noun.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-rule-04",
   "scene": "c05-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Here is the rule. The place of rafʿ.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "rule"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-rule-05",
   "scene": "c05-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Look at this sentence. He is a student.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-rule-06",
   "scene": "c05-rule",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هُوَ طَالِبٌ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "hl:هُوَ طَالِبٌ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-rule-07",
   "scene": "c05-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The word for he is the Topic.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "hl:هُوَ@2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-rule-08",
   "scene": "c05-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "A Topic is rafʿ.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-rule-09",
   "scene": "c05-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "But this word cannot show a damma. Its ending is fixed.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "hl:cannot show a damma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-rule-10",
   "scene": "c05-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "So we say it is in the place of rafʿ.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "hl:in the place of rafʿ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-rule-11",
   "scene": "c05-rule",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "فِي مَحَلِّ رَفْعٍ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "hl:فِي مَحَلِّ رَفْعٍ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-rule-12",
   "scene": "c05-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The ending shows no sign. But the job still gives the word its place.",
   "pause": 0.8,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-steps-01",
   "scene": "c05-steps",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "So we describe a fixed word in two steps.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "p:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-steps-02",
   "scene": "c05-steps",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "First its job. Then its place.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "hl:first its job, then its place"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-steps-03",
   "scene": "c05-steps",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Here is our sentence again, word by word.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "head"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-steps-04",
   "scene": "c05-steps",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The first word.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "row:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-steps-05",
   "scene": "c05-steps",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هُوَ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-steps-06",
   "scene": "c05-steps",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Its job is the Topic. Its ending is fixed. It never changes.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-steps-07",
   "scene": "c05-steps",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "So it is in the place of rafʿ.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-steps-08",
   "scene": "c05-steps",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The second word.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "row:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-steps-09",
   "scene": "c05-steps",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "طَالِبٌ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-steps-10",
   "scene": "c05-steps",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Its job is the Information. It ends in tanween damma, and you can see it.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-steps-11",
   "scene": "c05-steps",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "So it is simply rafʿ.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-steps-12",
   "scene": "c05-steps",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Both words are rafʿ. The Information shows it on its ending. The Topic has it only in its place.",
   "pause": 0.8,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-tip-01",
   "scene": "c05-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Good to know. There are three places.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "show"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-tip-02",
   "scene": "c05-tip",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "فِي مَحَلِّ رَفْعٍ",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "hl:فِي مَحَلِّ رَفْعٍ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-tip-03",
   "scene": "c05-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The place of rafʿ.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-tip-04",
   "scene": "c05-tip",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "فِي مَحَلِّ نَصْبٍ",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "hl:فِي مَحَلِّ نَصْبٍ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-tip-05",
   "scene": "c05-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The place of naṣb.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-tip-06",
   "scene": "c05-tip",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "فِي مَحَلِّ جَرٍّ",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "hl:فِي مَحَلِّ جَرٍّ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-tip-07",
   "scene": "c05-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The place of jarr.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c05-tip-08",
   "scene": "c05-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "In this stage, these twelve pronouns are always in the place of rafʿ.",
   "pause": 0.8,
   "cues": [
    "hl:always in the place of rafʿ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-title-01",
   "scene": "c06-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Chapter six. Sentences with a pronoun.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "title"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-examples-01",
   "scene": "c06-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Here the pronoun is the Topic.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "p:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-examples-02",
   "scene": "c06-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The Information is a noun, or a phrase that tells you where.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-examples-03",
   "scene": "c06-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "One. I am a student.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "ex:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-examples-04",
   "scene": "c06-examples",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَنَا طَالِبٌ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-examples-05",
   "scene": "c06-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The word for I is the Topic, in the place of rafʿ.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "note:1",
    "hl:أَنَا@2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-examples-06",
   "scene": "c06-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Student is the Information. It is rafʿ, with tanween damma.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "hl:طَالِبٌ@2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-examples-07",
   "scene": "c06-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Two. She is a teacher.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "ex:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-examples-08",
   "scene": "c06-examples",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هِيَ مُدَرِّسَةٌ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-examples-09",
   "scene": "c06-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The word for she is the Topic, in the place of rafʿ.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "note:2",
    "hl:هِيَ@2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-examples-10",
   "scene": "c06-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Three. We are in the classroom.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "ex:3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-examples-11",
   "scene": "c06-examples",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "نَحْنُ فِي الفَصْلِ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-examples-12",
   "scene": "c06-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The word for we is the Topic, in the place of rafʿ.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "note:3",
    "hl:نَحْنُ@2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-examples-13",
   "scene": "c06-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The classroom is jarr, with kasra.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "hl:الفَصْلِ@2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-examples-14",
   "scene": "c06-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It comes after a preposition, the word for in.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "hl:فِي@2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-examples-15",
   "scene": "c06-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Four. They are in the mosque.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "ex:4"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-examples-16",
   "scene": "c06-examples",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هُمْ فِي المَسْجِدِ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-examples-17",
   "scene": "c06-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The word for they is the Topic, in the place of rafʿ.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "note:4",
    "hl:هُمْ@2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-examples-18",
   "scene": "c06-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Five. You two are in the house.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "ex:5"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-examples-19",
   "scene": "c06-examples",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَنْتُمَا فِي البَيْتِ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-examples-20",
   "scene": "c06-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The word for you two is the Topic, in the place of rafʿ.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "note:5",
    "hl:أَنْتُمَا@2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c06-examples-21",
   "scene": "c06-examples",
   "lang": "en",
